      I  0.1924666300  0.3012201800  0.1905966500
      I  0.8075333700  0.6987798200  0.8094033500
    &END COORD
    &KIND I
      BASIS_SET DZVP-MOLOPT-SR-GTH
      POTENTIAL GTH-PBE-q7
    &END KIND
    &KIND P
      BASIS_SET DZVP-MOLOPT-SR-GTH
      POTENTIAL GTH-PBE-q5
    &END KIND
